$comment
Water B3LYP/6-31G(d) VPT2 anharmonic frequency calculation.
ANHAR = TRUE enables Q-Chem's VPT2 anharmonic post-treatment after the
harmonic Hessian is built. Some Q-Chem 6 builds use a $vpt2 block for
finer control; the defaults here match the basic VPT2 workflow.
$end

$molecule
0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117176
H   0.000000   0.757601  -0.468704
H   0.000000  -0.757601  -0.468704
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE     freq
   METHOD      b3lyp
   BASIS       6-31G*
   ANHAR       true
$end
